error[type-mismatch] 6:19-6:33
    (map (fn [o] (+ (get o :total) 1)) all))
                    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  This is an Option<Int>, but an Int is needed here.
  Expected: Int
  Found: Option<Int>
  The field :total is optional: a tool declares it optional, or the records that reach this point do not all have it.
  Sx does not narrow a field by a flag such as :known, so testing a flag does not make :total present.
  Match on it, or give get a default: (get o :total DEFAULT).
  Fix: (match (get o :total) (some total) ... none ...)
